OpenTAKServer deployment for the Build with Parallel Raspberry Pi 5 image.

The firmware includes Docker, Docker Compose, this deployment, and an
OpenWrt procd service. The service is enabled by default and stores its data
under /opt/opentakserver, which is on the writable OpenWrt overlay.

On first start Docker pulls the ARM64 OpenTAKServer images from their
registries. Internet access is required for that first pull unless an
offline-images.tar.zst bundle is supplied in /opt/opentakserver or mounted at
/mnt/opentakserver. The bundle is removed after import to preserve storage.

Edit /opt/opentakserver/ots_config.env before creating users if you need a
specific database password. The example password is randomized automatically
on first service start. Direct service ports are 8090 (web UI), 8091 (API),
8088 (TCP CoT), and 8089 (TLS CoT).
